1
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:23,200
Good morning. May I have your name?

2
00:00:23,344 --> 00:00:27,248
Good morning. My name is Emma Miller.

3
00:00:27,728 --> 00:00:29,424
How do you spell your name?

4
00:00:29,632 --> 00:00:40,112
E-M-M-A, Emma. M-I-L-L-E-R, Miller.

5
00:00:40,448 --> 00:00:42,368
You can call me Emma.

6
00:00:42,944 --> 00:00:46,560
Nice to meet you, Emma. My name is Teng Fei.

7
00:00:46,784 --> 00:00:49,664
Nice to meet you too, Teng Fei.

8
00:00:54,656 --> 00:00:58,288
Hello, Wang Yaming! How are you?

9
00:00:58,528 --> 00:01:03,856
Hi, Helen. I’m fine, thank you. And you?

10
00:01:04,688 --> 00:01:07,072
I’m great, thanks.

11
00:01:09,248 --> 00:01:13,344
Oh, that’s the bell. Let’s go to class.

12
00:01:13,584 --> 00:01:15,664
Goodbye! Bye!

